WEBVTT

00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:03,150
How to set up your earthing bed sheet.

00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:07,850
Earthing sheets are either a fitted bottom sheet or flat top sheet.

00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:11,350
First, place your earthing sheet over your bed.

00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:16,670
Snap the cord onto the connecting tab on your sheet.

00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:23,260
Any bare skin contact will transfer the earth's energy to your body.

00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:26,760
To clean, wash in warm water with detergent.

00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:31,760
Never use bleach, whitening agents, fabric softeners or dryer sheets.

00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,760
Dry on low heat.

